        "text": "Minulý čas slovesa be má jen dva tvary: was pro I, he, she, it a were pro you, we, they. Zápor je wasn't a weren't. V otázce dejte was nebo were na začátek, did tu nepatří: Were you at home? Narození se anglicky vždy vyjadřuje minulým časem: I was born in… Letopočet se čte po dvojicích: nineteen fifty-five.",
